  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "向對手下跪使其大意，接著用\n頭上的刀對其劈斬的寶可夢的雕像。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n是純金製的嗎？總之是高價物品，\n因此還是別碰為妙……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54115C0D624B4E0B8DEA4F7F51765927610FFF0C63A584577528000A982D4E0A768452005C0D5176528865AC76845BF653EF5922768496D550CF300200100001BE01000A662F7D1491D188FD768455CEFF1F7E3D4E4B662F9AD850F9726954C1FF0C000A56E06B649084662F522578B070BA5999202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "擺著感覺很有來頭的扇子等物品。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n這些東西散發著要價不斐的氣息，\n因此還是別碰為妙……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64FA8457611F89BA5F8867094F86982D768462475B507B49726954C1300200100001BE01000A90194E9B6771897F6563767C8457898150F94E0D659076846C23606FFF0C000A56E06B649084662F522578B070BA5999202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看起來是收藏品？\n有某種掛軸和不知來頭的壺。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n價值不明但感覺要價不菲，\n因此還是別碰為妙……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B8D774F86662F653685CF54C1FF1F000A670967D07A2E639B8EF8548C4E0D77E54F86982D768458FA300200100001BE01000A50F9503C4E0D660E4F46611F89BA898150F94E0D83F2FF0C000A56E06B649084662F522578B070BA5999202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有某種掛軸和\n以銅鏡怪為造型的青銅鏡。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n價值不明但感覺要價不菲，\n因此還是別碰為妙……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670967D07A2E639B8EF8548C000A4EE5928593E1602A70BA9020578B76849752928593E1300200100001BE01000A50F9503C4E0D660E4F46611F89BA898150F94E0D83F2FF0C000A56E06B649084662F522578B070BA5999202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有某種掛軸和招財狃拉。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n價值不明但感覺要價不菲，\n因此還是別碰為妙……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670967D07A2E639B8EF8548C62DB8CA172C362C9300200100001BE01000A50F9503C4E0D660E4F46611F89BA898150F94E0D83F2FF0C000A56E06B649084662F522578B070BA5999202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "掛著某種掛軸和\n擺著某種競技用的棋子。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n價值不明但感覺要價不菲，\n因此還是別碰為妙……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "639B845767D07A2E639B8EF8548C000A64FA845767D07A2E7AF662807528768468CB5B50300200100001BE01000A50F9503C4E0D660E4F46611F89BA898150F94E0D83F2FF0C000A56E06B649084662F522578B070BA5999202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看起來像是以一種別名為\n海鬼的寶可夢為造型的壺。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n看起來像是高價物品，\n因此還是別碰為妙……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B8D774F8650CF662F4EE54E007A2E5225540D70BA000A6D779B3C76845BF653EF592270BA9020578B768458FA300200100001BE01000A770B8D774F8650CF662F9AD850F9726954C1FF0C000A56E06B649084662F522578B070BA5999202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "擺著一把看不出\n是真是假的……刀？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n可能會有危險，\n因此還是別碰為妙……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64FA84574E00628A770B4E0D51FA000A662F771F662F50477684202620265200FF1F00100001BE01000A53EF80FD67036709537196AAFF0C000A56E06B649084662F522578B070BA5999202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不會輸！\n我個人也是有非做不可的事的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D67038F38FF01000A6211500B4EBA4E5F662F6709975E505A4E0D53EF76844E8B7684FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "別在這探頭探腦的。\n閒著沒事做的話我就指派工作給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52255728901963A2982D63A2816676843002000A959284576C924E8B505A76848A7162115C3163076D3E5DE54F5C7D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B35427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是不想些方法解決塔的問題，\n大家會感到不安吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4E0D60F34E9B65B96CD589E36C7A58547684554F984CFF0C000A59275BB66703611F52304E0D5B895427FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "來舉辦個團隊對抗賽如何？\n比如鏽蝕組vs超Z隊。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n聽起來比由紫的企畫有趣多了吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F8682098FA6500B5718968A5C0D62978CFD59824F55FF1F000A6BD4598293FD87557D44007600738D85005A968A300200100001BE00000A807D8D774F866BD475317D2B76844F01756B67098DA3591A4E865427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳往後還是得繼續\n調查異次元課題才行啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n等調查點數累積夠了，\n就跟吉普索說一聲吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B35F805F8C9084662F5F977E7C7E8C000A8ABF67E575706B2151438AB2984C624D884C554A300200100001BE01000A7B498ABF67E59EDE65787D2F7A4D59204E86FF0C000A5C318DDF5409666E7D228AAA4E0080725427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有奇怪的規則\n就代表有誰從中獲利。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這就和鏽蝕組的利息一樣。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67095947602A7684898F5247000A5C314EE3886867098AB05F9E4E2D73725229300200100001BE00000A90195C31548C93FD87557D4476845229606F4E006A23300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請替我轉達給<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>。\n說我很期待<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā她他的新影片。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB66FF62118F4990547D6600100002018B00013002000A8AAA62115F88671F5F8500100003110000FF010159794ED6768465B05F717247300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷的象徵發生了異常啊。\n這就是所謂的不祥之兆吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F776848C615FB5767C751F4E8675705E38554A3002000A90195C31662F62408B0276844E0D79654E4B51465427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在，\n不知為何老大的心情就會很好。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898100100003110000FF01014F6059B35728FF0C000A4E0D77E570BA4F558001592776845FC360C55C3167035F88597D300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "全像上會顯示出現在\n密阿雷市的異次元扭洞<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n以及與扭洞相關的各種數值。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "516850CF4E0A6703986F793A51FA73FE5728000A5BC6963F96F75E02768475706B215143626D6D1E00100001BE00000A4EE553CA8207626D6D1E76F895DC768454047A2E6578503C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "希望我們今後也能保持適當的距離，\n請多關照了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E0C671B621150114ECA5F8C4E5F80FD4FDD63019069757676848DDD96E2FF0C000A8ACB591A95DC71674E86300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    }
